    // A `PRAGMA` takes no bound parameters and the pragma table-valued functions
    // cannot target a schema uniformly (`pragma_freelist_count` rejects an
    // argument), so the schema name is interpolated as a double-quoted
    // identifier with interior quotes doubled.
    fn read_pragma_count(
